{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Once Upon A Tile",
    "steam_appid": 2465730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young wanderer is lost in the forests, and accidentally unleashes something evil. A group of strangers need to become friends and find their own path to salvation to lift the curse that has befallen the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/extras/0ee88ecb3888024364a1b4558fce0ca0.avif?t=1743071191\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Upon A Tile has you explore ever-changing dungeons guarded by monsters, traps and magical challenges. Perhaps you need to navigate a trap-filled corridor to the end, or defeat a certain amount of monsters or collect enough treasures to make it through alive. The reasons will change, but the goal remains the same - build the dungeon as you explore it, and avoid traipsing over too many traps or monsters you can not defeat yet. This will require a little bit of luck and a whole lot of strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you play as a hero, you do not move directly. Instead, you follow the shortest paths to the newly discovered dungeon rooms you are exploring. This makes for a very unique and challenging game, where every steps and tile you place counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Upon A Tile features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- endless replayability with procedurally generated dungeon-decks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- unlockable and upgradable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- an engaging, fully voiced storyline depending on which character you choose to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- complex mechanics that require you to think carefully, but easy to learn gameplay</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young wanderer is lost in the forests, and accidentally unleashes something evil. A group of strangers need to become friends and find their own path to salvation to lift the curse that has befallen the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2465730/extras/0ee88ecb3888024364a1b4558fce0ca0.avif?t=1743071191\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Upon A Tile has you explore ever-changing dungeons guarded by monsters, traps and magical challenges. Perhaps you need to navigate a trap-filled corridor to the end, or defeat a certain amount of monsters or collect enough treasures to make it through alive. The reasons will change, but the goal remains the same - build the dungeon as you explore it, and avoid traipsing over too many traps or monsters you can not defeat yet. This will require a little bit of luck and a whole lot of strategic planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you play as a hero, you do not move directly. Instead, you follow the shortest paths to the newly discovered dungeon rooms you are exploring. This makes for a very unique and challenging game, where every steps and tile you place counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once Upon A Tile features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- endless replayability with procedurally generated dungeon-decks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- unlockable and upgradable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- an engaging, fully voiced storyline depending on which character you choose to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- complex mechanics that require you to think carefully, but easy to learn gameplay</p>",
    "short_description": "Once Upon A Tile is a rogue-lite strategic dungeon-builder, where you don't control the hero! Instead, you cleverly place dungeon tiles to guide your hero to victory - or to their demise, if you are careless. You will need to be tricky and clever in this dungeon-building puzzle game!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
